        {
          "id": 3032028003,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Well no. This breaks the relationship between proxy and model. The correct approach would be to let the model send the signal to reevaluate because of changes and let the proxy recalculate. This patch actually breaks Qt model/proxy relationship and should be reverted. This is a bandaid NOT a fix",
